  "description": "Replacement of replaced Sash windows in Grade II listed property. The single glazed Sash windows and doors have already been replaced about 30 years ago. They are in such a bad condition, that another replacement is inevitable. Due to their single glazed characteristics the property can't be heated to basic needs despite the 15 KW gas boiler and additional electric heaters. It is therefore suggested to install double glazed sash winows with heritage slim spacers. Please also check if it would be possible to use plant on bars instead to improve thermal efficiency. ",
